  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tMTD IT\n\t\tMTD IT\n\n### Template upload for Foreign Property\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Wed, 15 Jul, 2026 at  5:06 PM\n\n\t\tTemplate upload for Foreign Property \n\nYou need to download the CSV template and populate the relevant information into the file and reupload in to the system as shown in the screenshots below\n\nNavigation : MTD IT >   Submissions > Client specific > Select view & Submit > Digital records > Template\n\n - Download the sample file\n - Populate all relevant fields in the file\n - Save the file\n\nNow reupload the CSV template into the system by selecting browse or use drag and drop files option to upload the file\n\nOnce the file is selected, click ‘Next’ at the bottom of the page.\n\nAfter you upload the file, the system will display\n\n1. Success list will show the records that have been successfully imported\n2. Duplicates list will highlight any duplicate entries in the file\n3. Error list will display records that could not be imported due to errors with the reason\n\n As shown in the screenshots below.\n\nOnce data is verified all the transactions would be imported and details would pop up as shown below and select the option ‘Done’.\n\n\t\t xlsx  foreign-prop... (21.2 KB) \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000118618\">MTD IT</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000201911\">MTD IT</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Template upload for Foreign Property\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Wed, 15 Jul, 2026 at  5:06 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: normal; font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Template upload for&nbsp;</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Foreign Property</span></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">You need to download the CSV template and populate the relevant information into the file and reupload in to the system as shown in the screenshots below</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Navigation : MTD IT &gt; &nbsp; Submissions &gt; Client specific &gt; Select view &amp; Submit &gt; Digital records &gt; Template</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><img width=\"624\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9244857041/original/f0datmIOqXEmhqfhPN5hr6py4thYQb-deg.png?1772112609\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9244857041\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><img width=\"624\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9244857039/original/MM6QFLRiEKPr3NBEcrxBG4cLlQOVFJRj0g.png?1772112609\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9244857039\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;margin-left:undefined;\"><li>Download the sample file</li><li>Populate all relevant fields in the file</li><li>Save the file</li></ul><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><img width=\"624\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9244857037/original/K_r6JTtSCYfWdD-JJV6oAAIhnUbCFoA0Tw.png?1772112609\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9244857037\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Now reupload the CSV template into the system by selecting browse or use drag and drop files option to upload the file</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Once the file is selected, click <strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\">‘</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-weight:normal;\">Next’</span></strong> at the bottom of the page.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">After you upload the file, the system will display</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">1. Success list will show the records that have been successfully imported<br>2. Duplicates list will highlight any duplicate entries in the file<br>3. Error list will display records that could not be imported due to errors with the reason<br><br>&nbsp;As shown in the screenshots below.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><img width=\"624\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9244857042/original/Scxa_c-OYfF5Ab_RCOaWrJ2WbYn0mg_8GQ.png?1772112609\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9244857042\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><img width=\"624\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9244857046/original/Aup1fiHnJmHvEqkam_NJ9-wNHd6QLhn3pg.png?1772112609\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9244857046\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Once data is verified all the transactions would be imported and details would pop up as shown below and select the option ‘Done’.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><img width=\"623\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9244857040/original/Bfjx1-sySxw9IEMbL9HVJzaPiC9KiKGOzA.png?1772112609\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9244857040\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 107%; font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t<div class=\"cs-g-c attachments\" id=\"article-9000274717-attachments\"><div class=\"attachment\"><div class=\"attachment-type\"><span class=\"file-type\"> xlsx </span> </div><div class=\"attach_content\"><div class=\"ellipsis\"><a href=\"/helpdesk/attachments/9251458126\" class=\"filename\" target=\"_blank\" data-toggle='tooltip' title='foreign-property_DigitalRecords_15072026_0406.xlsx'\n                >foreign-prop... </a></div><div>(21.2 KB) </div></div></div></div>\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000274717\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000274717/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-i